      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have an avatar that fails Impostorization (avtr_3460b0a5-b357-4fe5-a670-59c08f135083). It used to work before the VRCHeadChop was created.\n\n**What I changed between versions:** Updated SDK version. Removed the rotation constraint and the bone that allowed the ears to be visible. Reparented the ear bones to the head. Changed the physbone components to root the ears. Added the VRCHeadChop component. After uploading and checking that everything was working correctly I tried to make an impostor of the new version, but it always failed.\n\nI assumed the VRCHeadChop was causing the impostor creation to fail, but removing it and reuploading a temporary version does not fix it. It still fails.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
