      "value": "I can reproduce\n\nIn the picture i first tried to normally create impostors 4 times. Then i uploaded the avatar with everything outside the armature removed (stuff was still added in armature using the headchop component) and it failed again. \n\nAfter that attempt i tried removing everything included stuff within the armature and all additional scripts, successful attempt. \n\nOn the last successful generation in the picture i once again uploaded an avatar that has every feature added but this time i only removed the headchop component, successful generation. \n\nThe last try is me simply adding back the headchop component to see if it will fail again.",
